{title: Maajhe Rani Maajhe Moga}
{artist: Hriydaynath Mangeshkar Lata Suresh Wadkar}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A] Maaje raa [E] ni maa [D] je mo [E] ga,        tuje dola [A] yant sodh [E] ata th [A] haaw
[A] Maaje raa [E] ja, maa [D] je mo [E] ga,        tuje naa [A] waak jod [E] ata na [A] aw
Fulaafu [D] laank pushit aya [A] lo,        tuje [A] maaje priti [E] cho ga [A] aw
[A] Kaalaya kaalaya [E] dolayaann [A] tujya,        [A] Maajya [E] waata,
[D] waata [E] melataat [A] maaka,        [A] Tujya chhaatir [E] thhewata [A] maatha
[A] Fulaabh [E] aashen,        [D] bhaashen [E] halaki [A] duhkha
Tuje paa [A] yaan rup [E] ata kaa [A] ta,        maa [A] je kaalajaak [E] laagata [A] ghaaw
[A] Gor&#8205;aya gor&#8205;aya [E] rngaan [A] tujya
[A] Maajya [E] dolyaank,        [D] dolyaank [E] chaandany [A] aaraati
[A] Tujhya othhaar [E] sapana [A] maaji,        [A] Maaje [E] gaane
[D] gaane [E] houn [A] yeti,        [A] Tuje bhi [E] tur maaje [A] mana,
daryaa [A] wailya kirana [E] ncho bh [A] aaw
